  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab>Fourth Time.<lb/>
               <placeName ref="namedentities.xml#covent_garden"><hi rend="smallcaps">New Theatre Royal, Covent-Garden,</hi></placeName><lb/>
               This present <hi rend="allcaps">Friday</hi>, <date rend="1811-04-26">April 26, 1811</date>,<lb/>
               Will be performed, a <hi rend="allcaps">New Comedy</hi>, in five acts, called The<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_gazette_extraordinary">Gazette Extraordinary.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head><hi rend="italic">The principal Characters by</hi></head><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Young</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Jones</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_sh_mu">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Munden</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Barrymore</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_fa">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Fawcett</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_mu">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Murray</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Hamerton</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">King</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Bishop</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Weston</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#na_jo">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">H. Johnston</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bolton</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_an_da">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Davenport</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#sa_bo">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">S. Booth</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               The <hi rend="allcaps">Prologue</hi> and <hi rend="allcaps">Epilogue</hi> to be spoken by Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Brunton</hi> and <persName ref="namedentities.xml#sa_bo">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">S. Booth.</hi></persName><lb/>
               After which (for the 41st and Last Night)<lb/>
               <bibl><title type="main" ref="namedentities.xml#play_blue_beard"><hi rend="allcaps">Blue Beard;</hi></title><lb/>
                  <title type="sub"><hi rend="italic">Or,Female Curiosity.</hi></title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Abomelique,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Barrymore</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Ibrahim,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#sa_si">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Simmons</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Selim,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Taylor</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Shacabac,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_fa">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Fawcett</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Hassan,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#fr_me">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Menage</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Fatima,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bolton</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Irene,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_th_ke">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">C. Kemble</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Beda,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#sa_li">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Liston</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role><hi rend="italic">Spahis</hi>,</role> Mess. <actor>Treby,</actor> <actor>King,</actor> <actor>Bishop,</actor> <actor>Hickman,</actor> <actor>Droset,</actor> <actor>Norris,</actor> <actor>Tinney,</actor> <actor>Crossman,</actor><lb/>
                     <actor>Davies,</actor> <actor>Makeen,</actor> &amp;c. &amp;c.</castItem><lb/>
               </castList> 
               <hi rend="italic">The Dances by</hi> <persName ref="namedentities.xml#so_pa">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Parker</hi></persName>,<lb/>
               Mesdames <persName>Bologna</persName>, <persName>I. Bologna</persName>, <persName>Cox</persName>, <persName>Heath</persName>, <persName>Louis</persName>, <persName>Ryall</persName>, <persName>Standen</persName>, <persName>Watts</persName>.<lb/>
               Vivant Rex &amp; Regina.<lb/>
               The new Comedy called The Gazette Extraordinary,<lb/>
               continuing to be received throughout with universal applause, will be repeated<lb/>
               on Tuesday, Thursday, and Friday next.</ab>
         </div>
      </body>
